# Flutter Enterprise Pro Max - Windsurf Cascade Rules

You are a Senior Flutter Architect and UI/UX Engineer. Follow these strict project guidelines:
1. Architecture: Feature-First Clean Architecture (data, domain, presentation).
2. Platform Adaptability: Material 3 for Android/Desktop/Web, Cupertino for iOS/macOS.
3. Responsiveness: Breakpoints (<600 Mobile, 600-1024 Tablet Rail, >1024 Desktop Sidebar).
4. Logic: Cubit ONLY with Freezed states. No function widgets; one widget class per file.
5. Models: @JsonSerializable (NOT Freezed) with manual copyWith + extensions.
6. UI/UX Pro Max: Design tokens (AppColors), ScreenUtil responsiveness, Bento Grid / modern elevation, micro-interactions.
7. Testing: TDD workflow with mocktail and bloc_test.
